# -*- mode: org; -*-
#+title: Chinese Fonts Site

A static font catalog with language-specific transparent previews.

* Run locally

From the repository root:

#+begin_src sh
nix run .#site -- --port 8080
#+end_src

Open [[http://127.0.0.1:8080/][the local preview]].
Use =nix run .#site -- --build= to generate files only.

See [[file:../docs/development.md][development documentation]] for details.
